# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## 2025-10-06 / 1

### Added
- CHANGELOG
- Method to upload dataset to HuggingFace Hub

### Changed
- Recording is now saved as video to reduce storage size and for compatibilty
- Camera is created dynamically and using a lens distortion model and parameters that are more simlar to the 2MP Camera that is shipped with the robot


### Dependencies
- lerobot[feetech]==0.3.3
- ffmpeg=7.1.1
